  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Is she... no. What about... no. It is difficult to see Miranda Briar, my Scion. It is like trying to remember a dream from a year ago.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She slips in and out of perception. Even her actions send no ripples, only shards.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Fragments of time thrown out into the void, disconnected moments with no before nor after. I fear you must find her through more conventional means.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Is she right? Why do you ask? Is Miranda Briar right to hide herself from me, to act in opposition to me? Why would she be?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I have not removed choice from the Spiral, but I have lessened consequence.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Dragonspyre <italics>chose </italics>to wake the Titan that burned it. I never encouraged, nor influenced, them to do so.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But, yes, I knew that they would... and I could have stopped them. And if I had... they would have swarmed the Spiral as an invading horde.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Centuries of fire and death and enslavement would have resulted. Knowing this, haunted by this, would <italics>you </italics>have warned Dragonspyre?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You must look beyond what Miranda says, see only what she does and see it truly. She did not cure Darkmoor. She studied its Curse.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "She did not reach out to you, she escaped you. And she did not remove herself from my sight to do good things.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC07_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Return to the Arcanum, use their knowledge, determine where she has gone. We will continue our discussion another time.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Bartleby.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_WC-PreAH_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38230,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
